{"id":"662481","name":"番茄牛仔骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662481/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛仔骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛仔骨用厨房纸巾擦干水份备用。","img":"images/662481/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"番茄洗净切块。","img":"images/662481/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洋葱洗净切细备用。","img":"images/662481/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入牛仔骨。","img":"images/662481/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎至两面微焦。","img":"images/662481/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"珐琅锅热油放入洋葱炒香。","img":"images/662481/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入番茄翻炒。","img":"images/662481/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将煎过的牛仔骨放入锅中。","img":"images/662481/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，盐。","img":"images/662481/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/662481/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火煮开转小火焖半小时左右入味。","img":"images/662481/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662481/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662481/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}